WEBVTT

00:51:57.788 --> 00:52:00.538
an objective view about what makes us
happy and doesn't we're pretty,

00:52:01.413 --> 00:52:02.996
what's so great about it,
they're pretty good.

00:52:03.538 --> 00:52:05.871
But in any particular moment,

00:52:06.288 --> 00:52:11.788
we are subjected to our animal
instincts and it is easy for

00:52:11.788 --> 00:52:17.746
the lower brain to take over the eye. Well
, I think be an even higher brain.

00:52:17.996 --> 00:52:22.288
And as we can teach it, you know,
here is what we really do value.

00:52:22.288 --> 00:52:23.454
Here's what we really do want.

00:52:23.454 --> 00:52:26.746
It will help us make better decisions
than we are capable of,

00:52:26.746 --> 00:52:28.038
even in our best moments.

00:52:29.704 --> 00:52:33.246
So is that being proposed and talked
about as an actual rule?